From e44d6560e1e9f74061fc3ab385ec02a0250d24e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:33:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: migrate Groq model from decommissioned
 llama-3.3-70b-versatile to openai/gpt-oss-120b

- Groq decommissioned llama-3.3-70b-versatile on 2026-08-16 (cause of the 500s)
- Model now configurable via GROQ_MODEL env var
- /api/brief: lazy Groq client + try/catch (returns 502/503 instead of crashing with 500)
- Raise max_tokens since gpt-oss spends tokens on reasoning
